{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>As you say.</b> That you said, 'And remove the frogs from me and from my people' — and you did not ask to annihilish them from the world." "<b>So that you may know that there is none like YHWH our Elohim.</b> For no force can produce a change in nature except for some limited time, and the frogs in the Nile were then a newly produced change in the nature of the Nile — all the more so given that those frogs were different from every other living creature in that they move the upper jaw, bringing in but not letting out. And behold, the blessed El will eliminate them from you and from your houses alone."], :book :exodus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:24:47.693783485Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}